                        "entry_id": "b15c401c-e798-3fd0-b671-5fd39d5b0a41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sulphur-containing amino acid, C₅H₁₁NO₂S, in L- and D-forms.",
                            "The L-form thereof, a lipotropic molecule widely occurring in living organisms and found in most protein; in humans it is an essential amino acid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09ca4fde-0ab7-4ceb-94bd-1ef61f9573a6",
                                "sense_id": "218ba2bd-007e-3522-94d1-f6c53f60e132",
                                "text": "The purpose was to make soya beans more healthy for those for whom they are a staple food by correcting soya beans' natural deficiency in a chemical called methionine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
